  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "A madras is known for its heat and a sharp edge that comes from tamarind. Prawns cook in minutes, so build the sauce first and add the prawns only at the very end. They need no more than 3 to 4 minutes once the heat is back up."}]
      },
      {
